<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5c0126-zh-04adc4a5" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>莊子譯析</title><editor role="translator">Li Hui 李回</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>莊子譯析</title>沈陽：遼寧教育出版社，1993</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR5c0126"><title xml:lang="och">莊子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-08-23T06:52:48.206+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR5c0126-start"><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:54:52.591+09:00">任公子做了一个大鱼钩和一条很粗的黑绳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:55:05.712+09:00">用五十条键牛作钓饵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:55:32.866+09:00">蹲在会稽山头上，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:55:43.326+09:00">把钓竿投入东海，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:55:55.087+09:00">天天在那里垂钓，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:56:08.987+09:00">整整一年没有钓到鱼。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:56:28.647+09:00">一年过后，有一条大鱼吞食了鱼钩，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:56:49.916+09:00">牵动大钩</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:56:58.493+09:00">沉下水去，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:57:09.244+09:00">奔驰翻、腾而张开鱼鳍，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:57:18.333+09:00">白波涌起如山，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:57:27.522+09:00">海水为之震荡，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:57:34.857+09:00">声音如同鬼神，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:57:43.31+09:00">震惊千里。 、 、</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:58:19.855+09:00">任公子钓得这条大鱼，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:58:30.283+09:00">把它剖开晾成鱼干，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:58:43.21+09:00">自钱塘江以东，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:58:51.233+09:00">到、苍梧山以北，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:58:59.022+09:00">没有不饱食这泰鱼的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:59:10.603+09:00">事过之后；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:59:27.301+09:00">后世那些才智浅薄、街谈巷议的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:59:42.453+09:00">都惊奇地奔走相告。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:59:48.045+09:00">那种拿着小竿细绳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T06:59:53.525+09:00">跑向小沟小溪，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:00:06.332+09:00">等候着娃娃鱼、鲫鱼的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:00:14.143+09:00">要想得到大鱼就难了；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:01:04.85+09:00">那粉饰浅移之说来求得高尚的省声的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:01:20.299+09:00">要想通达大道理就远了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:04:12.511+09:00">所以不曾听说过任氏的风尚习俗的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T07:06:11.837+09:00">他的不能治理世事，相去也是很远的了。 【【浅析】这是一个极富于浪漫主义色彩的故事。故事通过任公子钓大638庄子译析鱼，表明必须是有远大的计划、长远的打算、坚韧剑毅力的人，才能经理世事，取得巨大的成就。 ，这则故事在艺术上的最大特色，首先是丰富的想象、奇特的构思。作者写任公子钓鱼，不在江河潮泊，更不用说寻常的陂池堰塘了而是蹲在会稽山头之上，投竿于无边无际的东海之中；在得鱼的时间上则是以年计算。这种想象和构思，显示出了雄伟的气象、阔大的境界，充分表现了庄子作品的浪漫主义色彩。其次，故事的想象丰富和构思奇特，又是通过极度的夸张和形象的描绘表现出来的。任公子钓鱼的鱼饵，竟是五十头大犍牛，他钓上来的鱼，竟大到可使从钱塘江往东到苍梧以北的所有人们饱餐一顿，这是向大的方向的宏观的极度夸张。而对钓得大鱼时的场面，又是用夸张的手法进行形象的描绘：那大鱼吞钩以后，"鹫扬而奋髻，白波若山，海水震荡”，形象而夸张地展现出了在东海之上捕捉大鱼时紧张而惊心动魄的场面，"声侔鬼神，惮赫干里”，更是极富于浪漫主义色彩的烘托渲染。，' '我们可以说，任公子钓大鱼的故事在其浪漫主义特色上是可以与《逍遥游》篇之大鹏的故事并肩媲美的。】</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:35:24.296+09:00">光曜何无有说：</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:35:38.181+09:00">"先生是有呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:35:46.996+09:00">还是没有呢?" •无有没有回答。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:08.629+09:00">光曜没有得到回答，仔细地观察无有的形状,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:15.624+09:00">深远莫测，空虚无物,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:22.16+09:00">整天看它却总是看不见，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:29.799+09:00">听它却总是听不到，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:37.128+09:00">摸它却是总是摸不着。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:45.782+09:00">光曜说:</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:36:53.375+09:00">"真是到极点了！</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:37:09.569+09:00">还有谁能达到这样呢?</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:37:16.919+09:00">我总算能达到有无的境界了，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:48:33.716+09:00">却不能达到没有无的境界；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:37:53.158+09:00">等到达到有无时就又是有了，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-17a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:45:42.144+09:00">怎么能够达到这种境界呢?"  【【浅析】这一则短小的故事借光曜对无有的羡慕，表现了作者对虚静境界的热烈追求。故事虽然极其简短，但却想象奇特、构思巧炫。把光和空虚用拟人的手法写成寓托人物，真亏他想象得出!有问而无答，寓答于问中，构思精妙之极！ "视其状貌,窅然空然，終日视之而不见，听之而不闻，搏之而不得"，以感觉、以行动去写静，以有去反衬无，空虚无有之形象俱现，变不具体为具体，如此描写，奇绝妙绝！】</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>